  copula binarized AT ITS OWN MEDIAN has share exactly zero, so that baseline
  sits at roundoff (1e-11..1e-13) and the excess/copula RATIO there is set by
  floating point, not by physics.  The meaningful number in that column is z,
  whose denominator is the measured estimator floor.  The ratio is printed
  because suppressing it would hide which column is which.
